{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new custom homepage section for a limited-time campaign.
    
    Section purpose:
    A compact horizontal campaign banner to place directly after the customer logo section and before the “Flowでできること” section.
    
    Design requirements:
    - Full-width section with a centered max-width content container.
    - Modern SaaS style.
    - Light background, preferably very pale green or light neutral.
    - Rounded card with subtle border and soft shadow.
    - Left side: campaign label, large heading, short description, CTA button, small condition note.
    - Right side: three compact benefit points.
    - Desktop layout: two columns, approximately 60% left and 40% right.
    - Mobile layout: stack the right benefit points below the main text.
    - Use Flow brand colors:
      - Navy: #0e366a
      - Green: #a0b842
      - Light background: #f6f8f3 or #f7f9fb
    - The section should be editable in the Shopify theme editor.
    - Include settings for label, heading, description, button text, button link, condition note, and three benefit items.
    - Do not include images.
    - Keep the design clean, simple, and conversion-focused.
    
    Default content:
    
    Label:
    期間限定キャンペーン
    
    Heading:
    まずは3店舗から。1店舗分、3ヶ月無料。
    
    Description:
    3店舗以上で導入をご検討の企業様に、1店舗分の月額費用を3ヶ月無料でご提供します。複数店舗で来店・売上・購買率を比較しながら、Flowの効果を確認できます。
    
    Benefit 1:
    3店舗から比較検証
    店舗ごとの来店数、購買率、売上KPIを確認
    
    Benefit 2:
    1店舗分を3ヶ月無料
    初期導入しやすい条件でスタート
    
    Benefit 3:
    本格展開を見据えた設計
    本部・エリア・店舗で活用できる運用を支援
    
    Button text:
    キャンペーンについて相談する
    
    Condition note:
    対象条件、店舗数、連携内容により適用条件が異なる場合があります.
    
    Technical requirements:
    - Generate a Shopify Liquid section file.
    - Include schema settings so all text and the button link can be edited.
    - Include CSS inside the section file.
    - Avoid external libraries.
    - Ensure responsive design.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-campaign-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.card_shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1 1 60%;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.label_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.label_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.label_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.text_font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background }};
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-condition-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.condition_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.condition_font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1 1 40%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.benefit_icon_background }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.benefit_icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-benefit-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-benefit-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.benefit_title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.benefit_title_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-campaign-banner-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.benefit_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.benefit_text_font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-campaign-banner-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .ai-campaign-banner-left-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-campaign-banner-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1 1 100%;
    }

    .ai-campaign-banner-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-campaign-banner-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.text_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-campaign-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px 16px;
    }

    .ai-campaign-banner-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }

    .ai-campaign-banner-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-campaign-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-campaign-banner-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-campaign-banner-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-campaign-banner-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.label != blank %}
          <div class="ai-campaign-banner-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.label }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-campaign-banner-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.heading }}
          </h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-campaign-banner-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.description }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.button_text != blank %}
          <a
            href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}"
            class="ai-campaign-banner-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
            {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.condition_note != blank %}
          <div class="ai-campaign-banner-condition-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.condition_note }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-campaign-banner-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.benefit_1_title != blank %}
          <div class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.benefit_1_title }}
              </h3>
              {% if block.settings.benefit_1_text != blank %}
                <p class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.benefit_1_text }}
                </p>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.benefit_2_title != blank %}
          <div class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.benefit_2_title }}
              </h3>
              {% if block.settings.benefit_2_text != blank %}
                <p class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.benefit_2_text }}
                </p>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.benefit_3_title != blank %}
          <div class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.benefit_3_title }}
              </h3>
              {% if block.settings.benefit_3_text != blank %}
                <p class="ai-campaign-banner-benefit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.benefit_3_text }}
                </p>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

